  Slug: cultist
  DisplayName: Cultist
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You were (or still are) a member of a cult whose rites may involve
    sacred dances to ensure a strong harvest or dire rituals that call upon dark
    powers. You might have taken up adventuring to further your cult's aims, to initiate
    yourself into the world's grander mysteries, or to flee unsavory practices or
    strictures. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Occultism skill and
    a Lore skill related to your deity or cult. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Schooled
    in Secrets] skill feat.
